  "delivered": [
    "All eight original public TVQ and PRIPEL callables are available before mining with independent editable complete raw source/query inputs and the direct PripelDiagnostics::to_json member. Existing cached anonymization workflows remain available.",
    "All eight TraceVariantQueryOptions and six PripelOptions members retain native defaults and explicit supplied-member presence, including canonical enum reopening, exact uint64/size_t values, ordered byte-string blocklists and secure_random. Complete raw EventLog, Trace, Event and metadata storage uses the existing public raw-log codec without an XES roundtrip.",
    "Complete three-field TVQ results, two-field PRIPEL results, twelve-field TVQ diagnostics and eleven-field PRIPEL diagnostics remain inspectable. The full ordered uint64 frequency map remains independent of capped emitted logs. Direct diagnostics text retains actual NativeString bytes without parsing them as JSON.",
    "All twelve artifact slots retain canonical source/query/diagnostics before and after fragments, configured options, complete typed result, released log, result diagnostics, raw native text and optional actual XES bytes. Compatible source/query/released logs and configured options reopen as actual Files; only eleven-field PRIPEL result diagnostics reopen as diagnostics input.",
    "Physical multipart requests retain control/upload ownership, bytes, order, query origin and absent versus empty filenames. One selected public native call owns validation and randomness; optional XES export errors remain distinct from canonical results. Secure output checks are structural and returned seeds remain configured seeds.",
    "The standalone Original anonymization workspace exposes full tables, CSV, selected records, raw responses, reports, original requests and exact artifact downloads. Native/API/portable/full frontend/strict build/live proofs are complete and bound below. The retained collector fault is completed by one missing-repeat call without replay. Browser rendering and every strict parity gate remain open."
